flowchart TD
    A[Pull request opened] --> B{pull_request<br/>or push to main}

    B --> C[terraform-plan<br/>read-only role]
    B --> D[Checkov<br/>IaC scan]
    B --> E[Trivy<br/>image scan]

    C --> F{All three green?}
    D --> F
    E --> F

    F -->|no| G[PR blocked<br/>deploy never eligible]
    F -->|yes| H{Push to main?}
    H -->|no| I[PR ready to merge] --> J[Merge] --> B

    H -->|yes| K[deploy job waits<br/>on production environment]
    K --> L{Reviewer approves?}
    L -->|no| M[Waits<br/>no AWS call made]
    L -->|yes| N[OIDC token minted<br/>sub = repo:ORG/REPO:environment:production]

    N --> O{AWS trust policy<br/>sub matches exactly?}
    O -->|no| P[AccessDenied<br/>AWS refuses regardless<br/>of the GitHub approval]
    O -->|yes| Q[Credentials issued<br/>about 1 hour]

    Q --> R[Build and push<br/>tag sha-run_number]
    R --> S{Tag already in ECR?}
    S -->|yes| T[Push rejected<br/>tags are immutable]
    S -->|no| U[terraform apply<br/>new task definition]

    U --> V[Wait for service stable]
    V --> W[New version live behind the ALB]

    style G fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c0392b,color:#7b241c
    style M fill:#fdf3e0,stroke:#c08a2b,color:#7d5a12
    style P fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c0392b,color:#7b241c
    style T fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c0392b,color:#7b241c
    style W fill:#e8f8ec,stroke:#2ea043,color:#14532d
